    "methods_description": "Brain electrophysiological activity was recorded from 52 participants using a 64-channel EasyCap system from Brain Products. The protocol consisted of 5 minutes of closed-eyes rest baseline, four experimental blocks with randomized exposure to conventional or unconventional hypnotic inductions framed as either hypnosis or relaxation control, followed by 5 minutes of post-hypnosis closed-eyes rest.",
